[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0010","text":"——哈，哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0020","text":"这样啊～\n透前辈怎么看～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0030","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0040","text":"这个布景也可爱～\n服装我也想穿新的～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0050","text":"……那就交给你了\n虽然歌和舞都还完全不行就是了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0060","text":"那当然～\n之后好好练不就行了～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0070","text":"『现在这样什么都谈不上』……呢\n刚才才被这么说来着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0080","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0090","text":"啊、不是！\n你说得对……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0100","text":"我觉得圆香同学说得没错……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0110","text":"我、我待会儿\n想再练一会儿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0120","text":"哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0130","text":"那雏菜\n去换个衣服～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0140","text":"啊……雏菜……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0150","text":"……辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0160","text":"嗯～！\n辛苦了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0170","text":"──小糸\n刚才……你是不是想说什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0180","text":"诶……啊，\n没、没有……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0182","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0190","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_02_0200","text":"……嗯\n好，再来一遍！"}]
